  "description": "Making a bet with… God?! \n\nJiyoung, an ordinary high school girl, just happens to come across God? God is fascinated that Jiyoung has never called for Him and suggests a bet: during His stay in the human world, if Jiyoung can suppress the urge to ask Him for anything, He will give her everything she can possibly wish for. She doesn't want to say yes, but who can say no when God looks this good!\n\n(Source: Manta)\n\n*Note: Includes a prologue.*",
